ged gesture paths in JSDOM and Chromium.\n\n### Notes\n- Reviewed the full branch diff for PR #4295, not only the latest commit.\n- Latest changes since the previous review are wording-only test updates; the underlying behavior and coverage remain consistent.\n- Drawer now only honors the namespaced swipe-ignore attribute, while Toast keeps the legacy alias for compatibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4035350299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4035351354","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4295#issuecomment-4035351354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4295","id":4035351354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs7whpM6","user":{"login":"pkg-pr-new[bot]","id":167837488,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCgD_MA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/882742?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/pkg-pr-new","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkg-pr-new%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":